  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Pressed Powder Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Radiant Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Silicones</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A clean, talc-free bronzer for soft, glowy, warm definition with the prettiest subtle sheen.<br><br><b>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Concentrated Fatty Acids: Soothe, soften, and reduce dryness.<br>- Baked Technology: Delivers the perfect amount of pigment.<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> This product is vegan, gluten-free, and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> Get soft warmth, definition, and radiance in one step. This smoothing powder acts like a golden-hour filter for a naturally bronzed look with the magical effect of sunset light. The weightless formula sweeps on effortlessly and is incredibly blendable and buildable, never chalky or dry. It’s so easy, you can’t mess it up.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Sweep everywhere you want a natural-, healthy-looking glow: cheekbones, nose, top of forehead, jawline, and collarbones. <br>-Apply in a light layer or build for more color payoff.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Concentrated Fatty Acids: Soothe, soften, and reduce dryness.<br>-Baked Technology: Delivers the perfect amount of pigment.<br><br>Mica, Limnanthes Alba (Meadowfoam) Seed Oil, Hydrogenated Vegetable Oil, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Silica, Hectorite, Soybean Glycerides, Phenethyl Alcohol, Tocopheryl Acetate, Caprylyl Glycol, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter Unsaponifiables, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter Extract, Oleic/Linoleic/Linolenic Polyglycerides, Tin Oxide, Sorbitan Tristearate, Ascorbyl Palmitate, [+/-]: CI 77163, CI77491, CI 77492, CI 77499, CI 77891. <br><br><br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Pressed Powder Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Radiant Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Silicones</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A clean, talc-free bronzer for soft, glowy, warm definition with the prettiest subtle sheen.<br><br><b>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Concentrated Fatty Acids: Soothe, soften, and reduce dryness.<br>- Baked Technology: Delivers the perfect amount of pigment.<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> This product is vegan, gluten-free, and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> Get soft warmth, definition, and radiance in one step. This smoothing powder acts like a golden-hour filter for a naturally bronzed look with the magical effect of sunset light. The weightless formula sweeps on effortlessly and is incredibly blendable and buildable, never chalky or dry. It’s so easy, 